<title>JAPAN: Nihonbashi Ware -6mth parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Nihonbashi Ware -6mth parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    PREVIOUS	   ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	   FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		855    million	 897    million	 936    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 117    million   loss 66    million  loss 217    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 118    million   loss 66    million  loss 221    million</p>
<p>NOTE - Nihonbashi Warehouse Co Ltd is a warehousing company handling textiles and electric machinery.</p>
